---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="회사소개"
  description="고객 중심의 최대 이익을 목표로 하는 ㈜혁본의 인사말, 경영이념, 조직구성, 수행역량을 소개합니다."
>
  <article
    class="w-full px-4 md:px-0 pt-20 pb-40 max-w-[384px] md:w-[712px] lg:w-[948px] xl:w-[1316px] md:max-w-none mx-auto text-26 md:text-30"
  >
    <h1 class="text-28 md:text-40">회사소개</h1>
    <div class="pt-4 text-16 break-normal">
      <p>고객 중심의 최대 이익이라는 목표와</p>
      <p>상품의 가치 실현에 무한한 책임감과 희로애락을 느끼는 기업입니다.</p>
    </div>
    <section class="pt-20 md:pt-32">
      <ul
        class="flex divide-y md:divide-y-0 justify-between md:divide-x-2 divide-gray-200 flex-row text-28 md:text-22 lg:text-28 flex-wrap"
      >
        <li class="w-full md:w-auto pb-4 md:pb-0">
          <a href="/about/greetings">
            <h3>GREETING</h3>
            <p class="font-light text-18 lg:text-22">인사말</p>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li class="w-full md:w-auto py-4 md:pt-0 md:pl-5 md:-mr-8">
          <a href="/about/hierarchy">
            <h3>HIERARCHY </h3>
            <p class="font-light text-18 lg:text-22">조직도</p>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li class="w-full md:w-auto md:pl-5 py-4 md:pt-0 md:-mr-6">
          <a href="/about/philosophy">
            <h3>PHILOSOPHY</h3>
            <p class="font-light text-18 lg:text-22">경영이념</p>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li class="w-1/2 md:w-auto md:pl-5 pt-4 md:pt-0">
          <a href="/about/capability">
            <h3>CAPABILITY</h3>
            <p class="font-light text-18 lg:text-22">사업역량</p>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <div
      class="w-full rounded-lg mt-10 md:mt-40 md:flex hidden md:h-[400px] relative overflow-hidden"
    >
      <div class="flex relative w-1/2">
        <img src="/혁본사무실.png" alt="" class="relative flex w-full h-full" />
      </div>
      <div class="w-1/2 relative">
        <div class="bg-black opacity-80 z-10 absolute h-full w-full top-0"></div>
        <div class="z-20 absolute p-10 text-white flex flex-col h-full">
          <p class="text-18">회사 연혁</p>
          <ul
            class="border-l border-solid pl-4 text-16 h-full flex flex-col justify-between py-2 mt-4"
          >
            <li class="flex">
              <p class="pr-6">2023. 07</p>
              <p>본사 이전 “경기도 화성시 동탄기흥로 614</p>
            </li>
            <li class="flex">
              <p class="pr-6">2019. 11</p>
              <p>주택건설사업자등록</p>
            </li>
            <li class="flex">
              <p class="pr-6">2019. 10</p>
              <p>납입 자본금 3억원 증자</p>
            </li>
            <li class="flex">
              <p class="pr-6">2019. 09</p>
              <p>한국부동산마케팅협회 회원사 등록</p>
            </li>
            <li class="flex">
              <p class="pr-6">2018. 03</p>
              <p>1군 브랜드 시공사 협력업체 등록</p>
            </li>
            <li class="flex">
              <p class="pr-6">2015. 06</p>
              <p>부동산 마케팅업을 목적으로 ㈜혁본 창립</p>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <img src="/혁본사무실2.png" alt="" class="relative flex w-full h-full" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
